  {
    "id": "ex10-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "10 Sunday drone stroll",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Headline joyride: arm \u2192 GUIDED \u2192 takeoff \u2192 DO_ORBIT circle \u2192 spin \u2192 FLIP mode \u2192 land. Each step chains on output 0 with completion/confirm tiers. ArduCopter SITL: bind 127.0.0.1:14550, remote 14551. Circle = DO_ORBIT (real command, not a path planner). Flip = FLIP flight mode (14), not MAV_CMD_DO_FLIP. PX4 would need different mode numbers.",
    "env": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ex10-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "ex10-tab",
    "name": "Sunday drone stroll chain",
    "info": "Chain on output 0 \u2014 completion where available (arm/GUIDED/takeoff/land), confirm for orbit/rotate/flip. Honesty: circle is DO_ORBIT (~200 m diameter at 100 m radius, center lat/lon/alt = NaN = current); flip is ArduCopter FLIP mode only (airborne + armed). SITL: sim_vehicle.py -v ArduCopter --out=udp:127.0.0.1:14550. Bind 14550 \u2192 remote 14551.",
    "x": 180,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
